{"id":"n85313-2-8","stage":5,"title":"성하다 · 完好","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85313-2-8-1","ko":"컴퓨터는 다루기 힘든 물건 같아.","zh":"电脑好像是很难操作的东西啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"컴퓨터는","meaning":"电脑","explanation":"컴퓨터：电脑；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72167","senseId":"1","lemma":"컴퓨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다루기","meaning":"操作，操纵，使用","explanation":"다루다：操作，操纵，使用；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"다루다","audio":"/audio/a6e7f8b1c109beaa90ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28346","senseId":"4","lemma":"다루다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"힘든","meaning":"难，困难，费劲，难以","explanation":"힘들다：难，困难，费劲，难以；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"2","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물건","meaning":"东西，物品，物件","explanation":"물건：东西，物品，物件","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"1","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"cff8b01657dff709","term":"컴퓨터","zh":"电脑","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3","entryId":"72167","definition":"利用电路线快速、准确地处理文件、照片、影像等大量数据的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"a6e7f8b1c109beaa","term":"다루다","zh":"操作，操纵，使用","audio":"/audio/a6e7f8b1c109beaa90ba.mp3","entryId":"28346","definition":"使用乐器或机器等。","pronunciation":["다루다"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"难，困难，费劲，难以","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"做某事不简单或不容易。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"东西，物品，物件","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"具有一定形状的某种物质。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/40dea33839586a219c35.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85313-2-8-2","ko":"아냐, 손가락만 성하면 쉽게 다룰 수 있지.","zh":"不，只要手指灵活点，就能轻松操作啦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아냐,","meaning":"不是，不对","explanation":"아냐：不是，不对","readings":[{"term":"아냐","audio":"/audio/775fa206224d591e4b76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65977","senseId":"1","lemma":"아냐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손가락만","meaning":"手指","explanation":"손가락：手指；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"손가락","audio":"/audio/72b09f1f28b0fd5244a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55504","senseId":"1","lemma":"손가락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"성하면","meaning":"完好，健康","explanation":"성하다：完好，健康；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"성하다","audio":"/audio/dd51253b3ebcbeee8a9d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85313","senseId":"2","lemma":"성하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쉽게","meaning":"容易，简单","explanation":"쉽다：容易，简单；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"쉽다","audio":"/audio/a39c0e9196a70295a55f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66314","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다룰","meaning":"操作，操纵，使用","explanation":"다루다：操作，操纵，使用；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"다루다","audio":"/audio/a6e7f8b1c109beaa90ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28346","senseId":"4","lemma":"다루다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있지.","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"775fa206224d591e","term":"아냐","zh":"不是，不对","audio":"/audio/775fa206224d591e4b76.mp3","entryId":"65977","definition":"用于强烈否定对方所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아냐"]},{"id":"72b09f1f28b0fd52","term":"손가락","zh":"手指","audio":"/audio/72b09f1f28b0fd5244a2.mp3","entryId":"55504","definition":"手掌的五个终端部分。","pronunciation":["손까락"]},{"id":"dd51253b3ebcbeee","term":"성하다","zh":"完好，健康","audio":"/audio/dd51253b3ebcbeee8a9d.mp3","entryId":"85313","definition":"身体没有病或问题。","pronunciation":["성하다"]},{"id":"a39c0e9196a70295","term":"쉽다","zh":"容易，简单","audio":"/audio/a39c0e9196a70295a55f.mp3","entryId":"66314","definition":"做起来不累或不难。","pronunciation":["쉽ː따"]},{"id":"a6e7f8b1c109beaa","term":"다루다","zh":"操作，操纵，使用","audio":"/audio/a6e7f8b1c109beaa90ba.mp3","entryId":"28346","definition":"使用乐器或机器等。","pronunciation":["다루다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/92ae829bbfbaa09d9a9b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.489,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=85313","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":168,"sequenceScore":3.3157,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不，只要手指灵活点，就能轻松操作啦。","电脑好像是很难操作的东西啊。","这种乱涂乱画的算什么艺术作品啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["电脑好像是很难操作的东西啊。","这种乱涂乱画的算什么艺术作品啊？","不，只要手指灵活点，就能轻松操作啦。"],"answer":2}]}
